From 5edcf573c8238d510c3ffa951b1584347a247eca Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 21:50:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Open Cartouche Cloud's page with the code of an account's
 page

On build.cartouche.cloud, the account's page gives the code that links
Cartouche to the account, and its Open in Cartouche button, or its QR
code on a computer, opens Cartouche with it:
cartouche://cloud/link?code=ABCDEFGH. That link now opens the System
page on Cartouche Cloud, which links this iPhone with the code at once
(launcher/Sources/CartoucheCloudLink.swift, decision 136); any other
link still opens nothing. The launcher reads the code itself and asks
the platform: LiveContainer only hands it the link.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MzPJosokqk1kiiFViHn8Gx
---
 LiveContainerSwiftUI/Views/LCTabView.swift | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/LiveContainerSwiftUI/Views/LCTabView.swift b/LiveContainerSwiftUI/Views/LCTabView.swift
index 542251c..9473825 100644
--- a/LiveContainerSwiftUI/Views/LCTabView.swift
+++ b/LiveContainerSwiftUI/Views/LCTabView.swift
@@ -108,6 +108,10 @@ struct LCTabView: View {
         // built-in SideStore's certificate to LiveContainer on its own.
         if url.isFileURL, CartouchePairing.openedFile(url) {
             sharedModel.selectedTab = .initial
+        } else if #available(iOS 17.0, *), CartoucheCloudLink.opened(url) {
+            // The link of a Cartouche Cloud account's page: the System page,
+            // on Cartouche Cloud, links this iPhone with its code.
+            sharedModel.selectedTab = .system
         }
     }
     
